Subject: [PATCH 77/83] lean: lane_host, native/cuda and server under 600 lines
 on current main

Upstream grew all three files to 591-600 lines, so the lanes' additions pushed them past
600. Moved out: a CUDA family's runner, compute lane and call gates on its Info
(native/cuda_lane_info.zig), the server's compute lane and runner at start
(server/server_lanes.zig), the queue-phase test (server/server_queue_phase_test.zig);
the lane host's held results and runner sessions take one call (lane_host_runner.step).
Nothing else changes.
